From 57ffa91d8d3d394184fbfb7e9ffaf20ccbc7a793 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zoltan Lakatos <zoltan.lakatos@streamhpc.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 03:46:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add wave32 CKTile INT8 A8W8 backend

- Adapt the upstream CKTile A8W8 prototype for
  gfx1100, gfx1200, and gfx1201.
- Use CK's 16x16x16 INT8 WMMA primitive.
- Keep the path explicit for backend comparisons.
- Pad unsupported dimensions before launch.
- Restrict output to BF16 and scales to FP32.
- Leave existing default dispatch unchanged.
- Add a default, CKTile, and Triton benchmark.

Tools used:
- Cursor: GPT-5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
